<title>USA: CryoLife Inc Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>CryoLife Inc Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three 3 Months Ended   Year Ended</p>
<p>			    12/31/96  12/31/95   12/31/96  12/31/95</p>
<p> Revenues		  $ 8,686   $ 7,044    $37,228   $29,226</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p> Preservation		2,862     2,204     12,593    10,485</p>
<p>General, administrative</p>
<p>  and marketing	    3,627     3,353     15,673    12,807</p>
<p> Research &amp; development    801	 628	2,807     2,633</p>
<p> Interest expense	     33	 ---	   72	   4</p>
<p> Total			 7,323     6,185     31,145    25,929</p>
<p>Income before income taxes</p>
<p>				 1,363	 859	6,083     3,297</p>
<p> Income tax expense	  468	 292	2,156     1,095</p>
<p> Net income		    895	 567	3,927     2,202</p>
<p>Earnings per share of common</p>
<p>  stock*			0.09	0.06	 0.40	0.23</p>
<p>Weighted average common and</p>
<p>common equivalent shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	  9,942,000 9,616,000  9,906,000 9,568,000</p>
<p>Note: (*)Adjusted to reflect the two for one stock split effected on June 28, 1996.</p>
<p>(In thousands, except share and per share data)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
